## Environment & Configuration Notes

- **Beads:** Use `./bin/bd` from repo root. Config has `no-daemon: true`; DB is non-legacy (repo ID set). See .cursor/rules/conventions.mdc (Beads section).
- **Agent Mail:** Server runs from `mcp_agent_mail/`; start with `scripts/ensure_agent_mail.sh`. MCP config in `.cursor/mcp.json` only.
- **Scripts:** Invoke from repo root (e.g. `./scripts/ensure_agent_mail.sh`).
- After git pull/merge: run `./bin/bd` as needed; no Django in this template repo. When this tree is copied to a Django project, run `uv run manage.py migrate` (or equivalent) after pull as usual.

